# Minimal tetrahedron — 4 vertices, 4 triangular faces
# Used to verify the OBJ parser in isolation (no rendering).
#
# Vertex layout:
#   0  top apex          ( 0,  1,  0)
#   1  front-right base  ( 1, -1,  1)
#   2  front-left  base  (-1, -1,  1)
#   3  back        base  ( 0, -1, -2)

v  0  1  0
v  1 -1  1
v -1 -1  1
v  0 -1 -2

# 4 faces (all counter-clockwise when viewed from outside)
f 1 3 2
f 1 2 4
f 1 4 3
f 2 3 4
